# Lessons learned

Cumulative record of mistakes surfaced by PR reviews, appended by the
`pr-review-fixer` sub-agent after `/mo-continue` applies review fixes. The
planning and implementation chains read this file before writing code so the
same mistakes are not repeated — `config.md`'s `## Lessons learned` section
points here.

Append-only; managed by `scripts/lessons.sh`. Each entry is a `## L-NNN` block:

